## Project

**"Signals & Systems — Interactive Simulation Platform"**
*(Sinyaller ve Sistemler — Etkileşimli Simülasyon Platformu)*

A collection of 16 browser-based interactive simulations developed for
undergraduate Signals & Systems education at İstanbul Medeniyet
University, maintained by **SPMI Lab — Signal Processing & Machine
Intelligence Laboratory**.

This work — including all HTML, CSS, JavaScript source code, KaTeX-
rendered mathematical content, simulation logic, visual designs, bilingual
written explanations (Turkish and English), and accompanying media — is
hereby licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)**.

* Full legal code: <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode>
* Human-readable summary: <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/>

