## Educational-Use Disclaimer

This platform is provided **for educational purposes only**. It is not
a medical, diagnostic, scientific measurement, or engineering-grade
tool. The simulations are pedagogical demonstrations of signal-
processing concepts and **must not be used** for clinical, safety-
critical, certification, or production decision-making.

---

## AI-Assisted Development Notice

A substantial portion of the source code in this project was produced
with the assistance of large language model (LLM) tooling
(**Claude Code · Anthropic**) and subsequently reviewed and edited by
the maintainer. Residual minor inaccuracies (mathematical, linguistic,
or implementation-level) may remain despite human review. Bug reports
and corrections are sincerely welcomed at the GitHub repository.

